### Login as ADMIN — copy access_token into admin_token variable below
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### Login as USER123 — copy access_token into user_token variable below
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user123",
  "password": "user123"
}

###

### Refresh token — replace <refresh_token> with the value from any login response above
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "<refresh_token>"
}
